{"availability":"available","full":"psviderski/uncloud","name":"uncloud","description":"A lightweight tool for deploying and managing containerised applications across a network of Docker hosts. Bridging the gap between Docker and Kubernetes ✨","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":5552,"forks":182,"created":"2024-07-20T11:13:36Z","updated":"2026-10-14T00:36:03Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://uncloud.run","topics":["containers","deployment","devops","docker","docker-compose","golang","kubernetes","orchestration","self-hosted","uncloud"],"demo":"https://labs.iximiuz.com/playgrounds/uncloud-cluster-64523f7c","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:49.443Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:49.443Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:49.443Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:14.142Z","stars":5513,"forks":181},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:12:22.429Z","stars":5514,"forks":181},{"at":"2026-10-06T17:12:14.248Z","stars":5516,"forks":181},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:26:59.414Z","stars":5520,"forks":181},{"at":"2026-10-11T09:01:13.889Z","stars":5524,"forks":181},{"at":"2026-10-17T11:00:46.053Z","stars":5549,"forks":183},{"at":"2026-10-18T21:03:49.443Z","stars":5552,"forks":182}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["▸ Deploy and scale containerised apps across servers without Swarm or Kubernetes overhead ◂","Uncloud is a lightweight clustering and container orchestration tool that lets you deploy and manage web apps across cloud VMs and bare metal with minimised cluster management overhead. It creates a secure WireGuard mesh network between your Docker hosts and provides automatic service discovery, load balancing, ingress with HTTPS, and simple CLI commands to manage your apps.","Unlike traditional orchestrators, there's no central control plane and quorum to maintain. Each machine maintains a synchronised copy of the cluster state through peer-to-peer communication, keeping cluster operations functional even if some machines go offline."],"features":["Deploy anywhere: Combine cloud VMs, dedicated servers, and bare metal into a unified computing environment,","regardless of location or provider.","need to learn a new bespoke DSL.","Zero-downtime deployments: Rolling updates without service interruption. Automatic rollback on failure is coming","Unregistry integration: Build and push your Docker images directly to"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/psviderski/uncloud/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"588198c418d083d16f181df29a742f6b965e48344d21bff202b53054a20275d9","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:26:54.805Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:49.507Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-14T00:36:03Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:03:49.443Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:31.012Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v0.21.0","tag":"v0.21.0","publishedAt":"2026-10-02T05:06:39Z","url":"https://github.com/psviderski/uncloud/releases/tag/v0.21.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:31.012Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/94143f839a8ec81ab618b0c7.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-15T22:07:31.395Z","url":"https://labs.iximiuz.com/playgrounds/uncloud-cluster-64523f7c"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://labs.iximiuz.com/playgrounds/uncloud-cluster-64523f7c","attemptedAt":"2026-10-15T22:07:31.394Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T22:07:31.394Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-15T22:07:31.394Z","target":"https://labs.iximiuz.com/playgrounds/uncloud-cluster-64523f7c","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-22T22:07:31.394Z","probeVersion":3,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"▸ Deploy and scale containerised apps across servers without Swarm or Kubernetes overhead ◂","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/psviderski/uncloud/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"588198c418d083d16f181df29a742f6b965e48344d21bff202b53054a20275d9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/psvidersk